Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootless jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken cellular iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the rootless layout under /var/jb and supports
 iOS 12 or newer.
 .
 Beta 3-1 adds Apple ConvergedIPC/Skywalk Bluetooth support and keeps the
 display cutout away from CarPlay controls on modern iPhones.
